  "conclusions": [
    "The uploaded report successfully covers all entries accepted by the current filter: 4,842 unique entries representing 16,090 matching events, with no output truncation.",
    "The newly visible Nimonix/RumbleFighter namespace conclusively establishes that the client reads per-user game settings. It does not establish that any observed setting selects the server.",
    "The launcher reads the root rumfus.ini; the client reads a different file at GameGuard/RumFUS.ini. The two paths must not be conflated.",
    "Missing RumbleLauncher.ini, RumbleFighter.exe.Config and GameGuard/GameMon.des.Config entries are unsuccessful probes, not evidence that those files supply settings.",
