    "The existing capture is adequate for this path-name investigation. Another generic startup capture or a dump of private registry values is not justified by these findings.",
    "A concrete next code-analysis target is the client settings-read/startup path associated with HKCU/Software/Nimonix/RumbleFighter and its networking initialization, subject to the existing protected-client limitation. This report alone does not justify modifying settings, inventing endpoint keys, or labeling the GameGuard INI a game-server config."
